#. ………………
msgctxt "0001 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. <CLT 4>昨日の霧切さんの言葉…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>What Kyoko told me yesterday...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>あれって…
#. 一体、なんだったんだろう…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>What the heck did it mean...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 戦刃むくろ…
msgctxt "0004 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Mukuro Ikusaba..."
msgstr ""

#. この学園に潜む１６人目の高校生…
msgctxt "0005 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"The sixteenth student, lying hidden somewhere in this\n"
"school..."
msgstr ""

#. “超高校級の絶望”と呼ばれる女子高校生…
msgctxt "0006 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "The one they call the Ultimate Despair..."
msgstr ""

#. 戦刃むくろに気を付けて。
msgctxt "0007 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Watch out for her."
msgstr ""

#. あのさ、霧切さん…
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Um, Kyoko...?"
msgstr ""

#. 何も答えないわよ…
msgctxt "0009 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "I'm not going to say anything."
msgstr ""

#. …え？
msgctxt "0010 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "...Huh?"
msgstr "...Hả?"

#. 何も答えられない…
msgctxt "0011 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "I can't say anything..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>霧切さんは目を細めて警戒していた。
#. その視線の先には…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0012 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Kyoko narrowed her eyes.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>…監視カメラ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0013 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Her gaze darted up to the surveillance camera...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. …わかるでしょう？
msgctxt "0014 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "...You understand why, right?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>つまり、黒幕に知られるとまずいほどの、
#. <CLT><CLT 3>重要な情報<CLT><CLT 4>…って事なのか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0015 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>She was trying to tell me that whatever it was, <CLT><CLT 3>it\n"
"was important<CLT><CLT 4>. The mastermind couldn't find out.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>だったら、霧切さんは、
#. そんな情報をどこで手に入れたんだよ…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0016 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But how did Kyoko get her hands on information that\n"
"could be that important...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. この話は…これで終わりよ…
msgctxt "0017 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "We're finished here."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そう言って、霧切さんは一方的に
#. 会話を打ち切ってしまった。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0018 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>She made it very clear that our conversation had come\n"
"to an end.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>いつも通り、詳しい話は
#. 何もしてくれないまま…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0019 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>And just like usual, I didn't understand anything any\n"
"better than before...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ねぇ、霧切さん…
msgctxt "0020 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Hey, Kyoko..."
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0021 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. <CLT 4>こっちを見もしない。
#. 今は、話す気はないって事か…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0022 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>She won't even make eye contact. I guess she really\n"
"doesn't feel like talking...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>室内なのに桜の木が植えられている。
#. しかも満開だ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0023 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Even though this room is totally enclosed, there's a\n"
"cherry tree planted here. And it's in full bloom.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. なかなか風情があるわね…
msgctxt "0024 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "It's quite elegant."
msgstr ""

#. 風情…って言うのかな…？
msgctxt "0025 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "This is what you consider elegant...?"
msgstr ""

#. 私は海外の暮らしが長かったから…
#. こういう日本的な風景が新鮮なの…
msgctxt "0026 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"I lived overseas for a long time, so this kind of\n"
"Japanese-style scenery is refreshing."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>間違った日本的…だけどね…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0027 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But considering our situation, isn't it kinda...out of\n"
"place?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>室内なのに桜の木が植えられている。
#. しかも満開だ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0028 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Even though this room is totally enclosed, there's a\n"
"cherry tree planted here. And it's in full bloom.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. なかなか風情があるわね…
msgctxt "0029 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "It's quite elegant."
msgstr ""

#. 風情…って言うのかな…？
msgctxt "0030 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "This is what you consider elegant...?"
msgstr ""

#. 私は海外の暮らしが長かったから…
#. こういう日本的な風景が新鮮なの…
msgctxt "0031 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"I lived overseas for a long time, so this kind of\n"
"Japanese-style scenery is refreshing."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>間違った日本的…だけどね…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0032 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But considering our situation, isn't it kinda...out of\n"
"place?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>木製の<CLT><CLT 3>ロッカー<CLT><CLT 4>がある…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0033 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There's a bunch of <CLT><CLT 3>wooden lockers<CLT><CLT 4> in here.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>それぞれのロッカーに木の札が差し込まれている。
#. なんだか、銭湯を思い出すな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0034 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The wooden lockers and keys remind me of super\n"
"old-school public bathhouses...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>鎧が飾られている…
#. ジャパニーズスタイルだな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0035 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>A suit of armor is on display. It's extremely\n"
"Japanese.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>巻き藁がある…
#. 稽古に使うんだろうな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0036 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It's a straw post used for sword practice. Did they\n"
"use it for training here, too...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>遠くに的が見える…
#. ボクって目はいいんだ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0037 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>That target seems pretty far away. Gotta say, pretty\n"
"proud of my eyesight!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. はい
msgctxt "0038 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yes"
msgstr ""

#. いいえ
msgctxt "0039 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "No"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>外に出ますか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0040 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Leave the area?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 23>Rời khỏi đây?\n"
"<CLT>"

#. <CLT 4>まだ気になる所がある…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0041 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I don't think I've seen everything there is to see...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
